  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Sun Palace gives out heated light so blinding that the air around it distorts with warm air, and intense heat assaults anyone nearby.",
      "chapters": [
        1711
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fairy Zi Wei recalls that Limitless Demon Venerable’s left path passes Central Heaven Gate, Name Plaque Palace, Sun Palace, Five Deity Hall, Central Great Hall, Heaven Overseeing Tower, Forgotten Dao Lake, and finally Imperfection Regret Pavilion on the peak of Star Zone Mountain.",
      "chapters": [
        1710
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_zi_wei",
        "char_limitless_demon_venerable",
        "house_central_heaven_gate",
        "loc_name_plaque_palace",
        "loc_five_deity_hall",
        "loc_central_great_hall",
        "house_heaven_overseeing_tower",
        "loc_forgotten_dao_lake",
        "loc_imperfection_regret_pavilion",
        "loc_star_zone_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Name Plaque Palace flees, Calamity Luck Altar reaches Sun Palace as the third obstacle. Even inside Calamity Luck Altar, Longevity Heaven’s members feel endless burning heat, and the altar’s surface starts melting when they try to charge close, with many mortal Gu charred. Sun Palace controls the illumination of the whole of Heavenly Court and has multiple light path rank eight Immortal Gu as cores. Its defense is weak, even lower than Central Heaven Gate, yet Calamity Luck Altar still cannot approach, and killer moves melt in the heat and light before they land.",
      "chapters": [
        1711
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "left-path-obstacle",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_calamity_luck_altar",
        "fac_longevity_heaven",
        "sys_mortal_gu",
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bull Demon says Sun Palace is strong on the outside and weak on the inside, and that getting in will let them destroy it. He and Flower Lady shoot toward the palace; Fairy Zi Wei surges its intensity from Central Great Hall; Flower Lady turns into pink light to shield Bull Demon and dies. Bull Demon still charges in, and after ten breaths Sun Palace is destroyed. Without it, Heavenly Court’s sky becomes dark. Bull Demon returns carrying Flower Lady’s corpse.",
      "chapters": [
        1711
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "left-path-obstacle",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_bull_demon",
        "char_flower_lady"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Once Sun Palace is destroyed, Longevity Heaven’s next target on the left path is Five Deity Hall, then Central Great Hall.",
      "chapters": [
        1712
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "obstacle",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In an Olden Antiquity Era recollection, before Limitless Demon Venerable, Sun Palace and Five Deity Hall are thin as paper.",
      "chapters": [
        1714
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "limitless-breakthrough",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "evt_era_olden"
      ]
    }
  ],
